.TH LINAL-RECEIVER 1 "October 2026" "linal 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
linal-receiver \- background receiver for Linal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B linal-receiver
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stays connected to the signal-cli daemon, stores every incoming message,
reaction, receipt and call in the Linal history, and raises notifications
and incoming-call ringing while the app is closed. Normally run by the
\fBlinal-receiver.service\fR systemd user unit, not by hand.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR linal (1)
